{
  "version": 1,
  "summary": "登录入口是 POST /api/login，核心由 AuthService 查询用户、校验密码并记录成功或失败日志，成功返回基于用户 ID 拼出的 session 字符串。",
  "coverage_note": "已检索 src/main/java 下 web、service、mapper、security、legacy、plugin，以及 src/main/resources/mapper 下 UserMapper.xml 和 LoginLogMapper.xml；调用索引对反射调用覆盖不完整，已结合源码文本核对。",
  "context": {
    "question": "登录逻辑怎么实现的？调用了什么，被什么调用？读写哪些表？",
    "scope": "搜索词：login、登录、password、authenticate、PasswordVerifier、handleLogin、signIn；重点文件：LoginController.java、AuthService.java、UserMapper.java、UserMapper.xml、LoginLogMapper.java、LoginLogMapper.xml、PasswordVerifier.java、LegacyJspLogin.java、PluginLoginBridge.java"
  },
  "findings": [
    {
      "text": "HTTP 登录入口为 LoginController.login，映射到 POST /api/login，接收 LoginRequest 的 username 和 password，调用 AuthService.authenticate；成功后把返回值包装为 LoginResponse。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:7b63c908",
        "sr1:b65ba9c9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "AuthService.authenticate 先通过 UserMapper.findByUsername(username) 查询用户；查不到用户时写入登录日志 USER_NOT_FOUND，然后抛出 IllegalArgumentException(\"用户名或密码错误\")。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:36e5cfa7",
        "sr1:9f7c0685"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "查到用户后调用 PasswordVerifier.matches(rawPassword, user.passwordHash())。当前实现实际只判断 rawPassword 非 null 且长度等于 3，storedHash 参数未参与判断；校验失败时写入 BAD_PASSWORD 日志并抛出同样的用户名或密码错误异常。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:36e5cfa7",
        "sr1:1618c59e",
        "sr1:777fa592"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "密码校验成功后写入 SUCCESS 登录日志，并返回 \"session-\" + user.id()；源码中未看到创建、保存或查询服务器端会话对象的逻辑，因此该返回值目前表现为字符串令牌而非已确认的持久化 session。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:36e5cfa7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "UserMapper.xml 明确从 report_user 表读取 id、username、password_hash、status，条件为 username = #{username}；当前登录流程只使用 id 和 password_hash，status 虽被查询但未在 AuthService 中校验。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:a05eee35",
        "sr1:36e5cfa7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "LoginLogMapper.xml 明确向 report_login_log 表插入 username、result、created_at，created_at 使用 NOW()；登录失败和成功分支都会写入该表。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:86e05f6a",
        "sr1:5a268396",
        "sr1:36e5cfa7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "除数据库访问外，已读源码未发现缓存读写、消息发送、HTTP 外部服务调用或其他外部认证调用；PasswordVerifier 是本地对象调用。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:36e5cfa7",
        "sr1:1618c59e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "存在遗留 JSP 兼容入口 LegacyJspLogin.handleLogin，它通过反射加载 AuthService 并调用 authenticate；源码注释说明这是新框架接管前保留的兼容入口。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:287b5673"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "存在插件入口 PluginLoginBridge.signIn，仅当配置 report.auth.plugin.enabled=true 时继续，否则抛出“插件登录未启用”；启用后通过反射调用 AuthService.authenticate。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:f6978ac8",
        "sr1:c7a86a16"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "callers": [
    {
      "name": "HTTP 客户端对 POST /api/login 的请求",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/report/web/LoginController.java",
      "detail": "请求体被绑定为 LoginRequest 后进入 LoginController.login。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:7b63c908"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LegacyJspLogin.handleLogin",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/report/legacy/LegacyJspLogin.java",
      "detail": "通过 Class.forName、反射获取 authenticate 并调用；静态调用索引未建立该调用边，但源码明确展示了调用。",
      "kind": "indirect",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:287b5673"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "PluginLoginBridge.signIn",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/report/plugin/PluginLoginBridge.java",
      "detail": "仅在 report.auth.plugin.enabled=true 时，通过反射调用 authenticate。",
      "kind": "indirect",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:f6978ac8"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "callees": [
    {
      "name": "AuthService.authenticate",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/report/service/AuthService.java",
      "detail": "LoginController.login 的核心认证服务；负责查询用户、密码校验、登录日志和返回令牌。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:7b63c908",
        "sr1:9f7c0685"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "UserMapper.findByUsername",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/report/mapper/UserMapper.java",
      "detail": "按用户名读取用户账户信息。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:9f7c0685",
        "sr1:35329808"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "PasswordVerifier.matches",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/report/security/PasswordVerifier.java",
      "detail": "比较原始密码与用户密码信息；当前实现只检查原始密码长度为 3。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:9f7c0685",
        "sr1:1618c59e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoginLogMapper.insertLog",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/report/mapper/LoginLogMapper.java",
      "detail": "在 USER_NOT_FOUND、BAD_PASSWORD、SUCCESS 三种分支写入登录日志。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:9f7c0685",
        "sr1:de2aec78"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "data_accesses": [
    {
      "object": "report_user",
      "category": "db_object",
      "operations": [
        "read"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "每次调用 AuthService.authenticate 时按 username 查询"
      ],
      "access_method": "SELECT id, username, password_hash, status FROM report_user WHERE username = #{username}",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:a05eee35",
        "sr1:36e5cfa7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "object": "report_login_log",
      "category": "db_object",
      "operations": [
        "insert"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "用户不存在时插入 result=USER_NOT_FOUND",
        "密码校验失败时插入 result=BAD_PASSWORD",
        "密码校验成功时插入 result=SUCCESS"
      ],
      "access_method": "INSERT INTO report_login_log (username, result, created_at) VALUES (#{username}, #{result}, NOW())",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:86e05f6a",
        "sr1:36e5cfa7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "object": "session-\" + user.id()",
      "category": "unknown",
      "operations": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "密码校验成功后生成并返回该字符串"
      ],
      "access_method": "return \"session-\" + user.id()",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:36e5cfa7"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
